            "id": 132651,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Desempaqueta los dos parámetros de consulta utilizando la desestructuración de objetos.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/search&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { type, category } = req.query;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>req</code> seguido de <code>res</code> y luego <code>req</code>, <code>query</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama <code>req</code> al objeto de solicitud y <code>res</code> al de respuesta. Después, desestructura los dos parámetros de consulta.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/search&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", (req, res) =&gt; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" { type, category } = req.query;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"method\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>req</code> seguido de <code>res</code>, <code>req</code> y finalmente <code>query</code>.</p></body></html>",
